      "text": "Hello everyone, good morning. I'm Anna. I'm speaking from Brazil from Recife right now and I'm very pleased to be here. Thank you for this opportunity. I'm the Director of the Institute for Research on Internet and Society, which is a non-profit organization founded in 2015 here in Brazil at Minas Gerais. And I'm here to share a little about our context regarding AI challenges, regulation and other things. And I dare to say that probably it's not that far away from the challenges that you are all facing abroad. So I will be glad to keep this conversation after this conference. And you can all reach me by mail and it will be a pleasure to talk and to exchange with you all.",
