      "end": 323.46,
      "duration": 96.75,
      "text": "And it is directed linkage with misinformation problem, for example, we gravitated with the popularization of AI that caused a lot to our democracy and our society. Another challenge is the availability and quality of connectivity infrastructure, which remains insufficient in remote areas and for socio-economically vulnerable populations. These obstacles highlight that digital transformation cannot be considered only from a technical perspective, but it must take into account the diverse cultural, geographic, and social realities of a surge large country as Brazil. Therefore, with technological development, we focus on a central concern in sharing that the new tools do not simply become a modernization of structural violence that has persisted from centuries in Brazil. But we believe that it is not allowed to build more sophisticated systems. We must ask what problems these systems are actually solving, who they are serving, and which voices are left out of the decision-making process when we talk about technological and scientific development.",
